        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBCC19, Clear Crystal Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is stunning. It pairs a rectangular 11\" tall plate with a matching clear crystal knob for maximum glamor. The Clear Crystal Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in a wide array of finish colors. This knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/baguette-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-plate-entryset-grandeur-favbcc19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Crystal Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Clear Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBCC19-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBCC19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate",
                "description": "The Baguette Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is stunning. It pairs a rectangular tall plate rosette with a matching clear crystal knob for maximum glamor. The Clear Crystal Baguette Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in a wide array of finish colors.This knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n\r\n",
